{"n":58,"name":"Al-Mujadila","nameAr":"المجادلة","meaning":"The Pleading Woman","ayahs":22,"place":"madinah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":28,"ar":"قَدْ سَمِعَ ٱللَّهُ قَوْلَ ٱلَّتِى تُجَـٰدِلُكَ فِى زَوْجِهَا وَتَشْتَكِىٓ إِلَى ٱللَّهِ وَٱللَّهُ يَسْمَعُ تَحَاوُرَكُمَآ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ سَمِيعٌۢ بَصِيرٌ","en":"Certainly has Allāh heard the speech of the one who argues [i.e., pleads] with you, [O Muḥammad], concerning her husband and directs her complaint to Allāh. And Allāh hears your dialogue; indeed, Allāh is Hearing and Seeing.","w":[{"ar":"قَدْ","tr":"qad","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"سَمِعَ","tr":"samiʿa","en":"Allah has heard","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah has heard","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"قَوْلَ","tr":"qawla","en":"(the) speech","root":"قول","lem":"قَوْل"},{"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","tr":"allatī","en":"(of one) who"},{"ar":"تُجَـٰدِلُكَ","tr":"tujādiluka","en":"disputes with you","root":"جدل","lem":"جادَلُ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"concerning"},{"ar":"زَوْجِهَا","tr":"zawjihā","en":"her husband","root":"زوج","lem":"زَوْج"},{"ar":"وَتَشْتَكِىٓ","tr":"watashtakī","en":"and she directs her complaint","root":"شكو","lem":"تَشْتَكِي"},{"ar":"إِلَى","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"And Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"يَسْمَعُ","tr":"yasmaʿu","en":"hears","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"},{"ar":"تَحَاوُرَكُمَآ ۚ","tr":"taḥāwurakumā","en":"(the) dialogue of both of you","root":"حور","lem":"تَحاوُر"},{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"سَمِيعٌۢ","tr":"samīʿun","en":"(is) All-Hearer","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِيع"},{"ar":"بَصِيرٌ","tr":"baṣīrun","en":"All-Seer","root":"بصر","lem":"بَصِير"}]},{"n":2,"juz":28,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ يُظَـٰهِرُونَ مِنكُم مِّن نِّسَآئِهِم مَّا هُنَّ أُمَّهَـٰتِهِمْ ۖ إِنْ أُمَّهَـٰتُهُمْ إِلَّا ٱلَّـٰٓـِٔى وَلَدْنَهُمْ ۚ وَإِنَّهُمْ لَيَقُولُونَ مُنكَرًا مِّنَ ٱلْقَوْلِ وَزُورًا ۚ وَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَعَفُوٌّ غَفُورٌ","en":"Those who pronounce ẓihār among you [to separate] from their wives - they are not [consequently] their mothers. Their mothers are none but those who gave birth to them. And indeed, they are saying an objectionable statement and a falsehood. But indeed, Allāh is Pardoning and Forgiving.","w":[{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"Those who"},{"ar":"يُظَـٰهِرُونَ","tr":"yuẓāhirūna","en":"pronounce zihar","root":"ظهر","lem":"ظاهَرُ"},{"ar":"مِنكُم","tr":"minkum","en":"among you"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"[from]"},{"ar":"نِّسَآئِهِم","tr":"nisāihim","en":"(to) their wives","root":"نسو","lem":"نِساء"},{"ar":"مَّا","tr":"mā","en":"not"},{"ar":"هُنَّ","tr":"hunna","en":"they"},{"ar":"أُمَّهَـٰتِهِمْ ۖ","tr":"ummahātihim","en":"(are) their mothers","root":"أمم","lem":"أُمّ"},{"ar":"إِنْ","tr":"in","en":"Not"},{"ar":"أُمَّهَـٰتُهُمْ","tr":"ummahātuhum","en":"(are) their mothers","root":"أمم","lem":"أُمّ"},{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"except"},{"ar":"ٱلَّـٰٓـِٔى","tr":"allāī","en":"those who"},{"ar":"وَلَدْنَهُمْ ۚ","tr":"waladnahum","en":"gave them birth","root":"ولد","lem":"وَلَدَ"},{"ar":"وَإِنَّهُمْ","tr":"wa-innahum","en":"And indeed, they"},{"ar":"لَيَقُولُونَ","tr":"layaqūlūna","en":"surely say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"مُنكَرًۭا","tr":"munkaran","en":"an evil","root":"نكر","lem":"مُنكَر"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"[of]"},{"ar":"ٱلْقَوْلِ","tr":"l-qawli","en":"[the] word","root":"قول","lem":"قَوْل"},{"ar":"وَزُورًۭا ۚ","tr":"wazūran","en":"and a lie","root":"زور","lem":"زُور"},{"ar":"وَإِنَّ","tr":"wa-inna","en":"But indeed"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"لَعَفُوٌّ","tr":"laʿafuwwun","en":"(is) surely, Oft-Pardoning","root":"عفو","lem":"عَفُوّ"},{"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","tr":"ghafūrun","en":"Oft-Forgiving","root":"غفر","lem":"غَفُور"}]},{"n":3,"juz":28,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ يُظَـٰهِرُونَ مِن نِّسَآئِهِمْ ثُمَّ يَعُودُونَ لِمَا قَالُوا۟ فَتَحْرِيرُ رَقَبَةٍ مِّن قَبْلِ أَن يَتَمَآسَّا ۚ ذَٰلِكُمْ تُوعَظُونَ بِهِۦ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ خَبِيرٌ","en":"And those who pronounce ẓihār from their wives and then [wish to] go back on what they said - then [there must be] the freeing of a slave before they touch one another. That is what you are admonished thereby; and Allāh is Aware of what you do.","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"wa-alladhīna","en":"And those who"},{"ar":"يُظَـٰهِرُونَ","tr":"yuẓāhirūna","en":"pronounce zihar","root":"ظهر","lem":"ظاهَرُ"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"[from]"},{"ar":"نِّسَآئِهِمْ","tr":"nisāihim","en":"(to) their wives","root":"نسو","lem":"نِساء"},{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"then"},{"ar":"يَعُودُونَ","tr":"yaʿūdūna","en":"go back","root":"عود","lem":"عادَ"},{"ar":"لِمَا","tr":"limā","en":"on what"},{"ar":"قَالُوا۟","tr":"qālū","en":"they said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"فَتَحْرِيرُ","tr":"fataḥrīru","en":"then freeing","root":"حرر","lem":"تَحْرِير"},{"ar":"رَقَبَةٍۢ","tr":"raqabatin","en":"(of) a slave","root":"رقب","lem":"رَقَبَة"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"before"},{"ar":"قَبْلِ","tr":"qabli","en":"before","root":"قبل","lem":"قَبْل"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"[that]"},{"ar":"يَتَمَآسَّا ۚ","tr":"yatamāssā","en":"they touch each other","root":"مسس","lem":"يَتَماسَّ"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكُمْ","tr":"dhālikum","en":"That"},{"ar":"تُوعَظُونَ","tr":"tūʿaẓūna","en":"you are admonished","root":"وعظ","lem":"وَعَظْ"},{"ar":"بِهِۦ ۚ","tr":"bihi","en":"to it"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"And Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"بِمَا","tr":"bimā","en":"of what"},{"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","tr":"taʿmalūna","en":"you do","root":"عمل","lem":"عَمِلَ"},{"ar":"خَبِيرٌۭ","tr":"khabīrun","en":"(is) All-Aware","root":"خبر","lem":"خَبِير"}]},{"n":4,"juz":28,"ar":"فَمَن لَّمْ يَجِدْ فَصِيَامُ شَهْرَيْنِ مُتَتَابِعَيْنِ مِن قَبْلِ أَن يَتَمَآسَّا ۖ فَمَن لَّمْ يَسْتَطِعْ فَإِطْعَامُ سِتِّينَ مِسْكِينًا ۚ ذَٰلِكَ لِتُؤْمِنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۚ وَتِلْكَ حُدُودُ ٱللَّهِ ۗ وَلِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","en":"And he who does not find [a slave] - then a fast for two months consecutively before they touch one another; and he who is unable - then the feeding of sixty poor persons. That is for you to believe [completely] in Allāh and His Messenger; and those are the limits [set by] Allāh. And for the disbelievers is a painful punishment.","w":[{"ar":"فَمَن","tr":"faman","en":"Then whoever"},{"ar":"لَّمْ","tr":"lam","en":"(does) not"},{"ar":"يَجِدْ","tr":"yajid","en":"find","root":"وجد","lem":"وَجَدَ"},{"ar":"فَصِيَامُ","tr":"faṣiyāmu","en":"then fasting","root":"صوم","lem":"صِيام"},{"ar":"شَهْرَيْنِ","tr":"shahrayni","en":"(for) two months","root":"شهر","lem":"شَهْر"},{"ar":"مُتَتَابِعَيْنِ","tr":"mutatābiʿayni","en":"consecutively","root":"تبع","lem":"مُتَتابِعَيْن"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"before"},{"ar":"قَبْلِ","tr":"qabli","en":"before","root":"قبل","lem":"قَبْل"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"[that]"},{"ar":"يَتَمَآسَّا ۖ","tr":"yatamāssā","en":"they both touch each other","root":"مسس","lem":"يَتَماسَّ"},{"ar":"فَمَن","tr":"faman","en":"But (he) who"},{"ar":"لَّمْ","tr":"lam","en":"not"},{"ar":"يَسْتَطِعْ","tr":"yastaṭiʿ","en":"is able","root":"طوع","lem":"اسْتَطاعَ"},{"ar":"فَإِطْعَامُ","tr":"fa-iṭ'ʿāmu","en":"then (the) feeding","root":"طعم","lem":"إِطْعام"},{"ar":"سِتِّينَ","tr":"sittīna","en":"(of) sixty","root":"ستت","lem":"سِتِّين"},{"ar":"مِسْكِينًۭا ۚ","tr":"mis'kīnan","en":"needy one(s)","root":"سكن","lem":"مِسْكِين"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"That "},{"ar":"لِتُؤْمِنُوا۟","tr":"litu'minū","en":"so that you may believe","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","tr":"bil-lahi","en":"in Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۚ","tr":"warasūlihi","en":"and His Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"وَتِلْكَ","tr":"watil'ka","en":"and these"},{"ar":"حُدُودُ","tr":"ḥudūdu","en":"(are the) limits","root":"حدد","lem":"حُدُود"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَلِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","tr":"walil'kāfirīna","en":"and for the disbelievers","root":"كفر","lem":"كافِر"},{"ar":"عَذَابٌ","tr":"ʿadhābun","en":"(is) a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"أَلِيمٌ","tr":"alīmun","en":"painful","root":"ألم","lem":"أَلِيم"}]},{"n":5,"juz":28,"ar":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يُحَآدُّونَ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ كُبِتُوا۟ كَمَا كُبِتَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ وَقَدْ أَنزَلْنَآ ءَايَـٰتٍۭ بَيِّنَـٰتٍ ۚ وَلِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ عَذَابٌ مُّهِينٌ","en":"Indeed, those who oppose Allāh and His Messenger are abased as those before them were abased. And We have certainly sent down verses of clear evidence. And for the disbelievers is a humiliating punishment","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"يُحَآدُّونَ","tr":"yuḥāddūna","en":"oppose","root":"حدد","lem":"يُحادُّ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","tr":"warasūlahu","en":"and His Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"كُبِتُوا۟","tr":"kubitū","en":"(will) be disgraced","root":"كبت","lem":"كُبِتَ"},{"ar":"كَمَا","tr":"kamā","en":"as"},{"ar":"كُبِتَ","tr":"kubita","en":"were disgraced","root":"كبت","lem":"كُبِتَ"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"before them"},{"ar":"قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ","tr":"qablihim","en":"before them","root":"قبل","lem":"قَبْل"},{"ar":"وَقَدْ","tr":"waqad","en":"And certainly"},{"ar":"أَنزَلْنَآ","tr":"anzalnā","en":"We have sent down","root":"نزل","lem":"أَنزَلَ"},{"ar":"ءَايَـٰتٍۭ","tr":"āyātin","en":"Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ ۚ","tr":"bayyinātin","en":"clear","root":"بين","lem":"بَيِّنَة"},{"ar":"وَلِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","tr":"walil'kāfirīna","en":"And for the disbelievers","root":"كفر","lem":"كافِر"},{"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","tr":"ʿadhābun","en":"(is) a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"مُّهِينٌۭ","tr":"muhīnun","en":"humiliating","root":"هون","lem":"مُهِين"}]},{"n":6,"juz":28,"ar":"يَوْمَ يَبْعَثُهُمُ ٱللَّهُ جَمِيعًا فَيُنَبِّئُهُم بِمَا عَمِلُوٓا۟ ۚ أَحْصَىٰهُ ٱللَّهُ وَنَسُوهُ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ شَهِيدٌ","en":"On the Day when Allāh will resurrect them all and inform them of what they did. Allāh had enumerated it, while they forgot it; and Allāh is, over all things, Witness.","w":[{"ar":"يَوْمَ","tr":"yawma","en":"(On the) Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"يَبْعَثُهُمُ","tr":"yabʿathuhumu","en":"(when) Allah will raise them","root":"بعث","lem":"بَعَثَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"(when) Allah will raise them","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"جَمِيعًۭا","tr":"jamīʿan","en":"all","root":"جمع","lem":"جَمِيع"},{"ar":"فَيُنَبِّئُهُم","tr":"fayunabbi-uhum","en":"and inform them","root":"نبأ","lem":"نَبَّأَ"},{"ar":"بِمَا","tr":"bimā","en":"of what"},{"ar":"عَمِلُوٓا۟ ۚ","tr":"ʿamilū","en":"they did","root":"عمل","lem":"عَمِلَ"},{"ar":"أَحْصَىٰهُ","tr":"aḥṣāhu","en":"Allah has recorded it","root":"حصي","lem":"أَحْصَى"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah has recorded it","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَنَسُوهُ ۚ","tr":"wanasūhu","en":"while they forgot it","root":"نسي","lem":"نَسِيَ"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"And Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"(is) over"},{"ar":"كُلِّ","tr":"kulli","en":"all","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","tr":"shayin","en":"things","root":"شيأ","lem":"شَىْء"},{"ar":"شَهِيدٌ","tr":"shahīdun","en":"a Witness","root":"شهد","lem":"شَهِيد"}]},{"n":7,"juz":28,"ar":"أَلَمْ تَرَ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَعْلَمُ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ مَا يَكُونُ مِن نَّجْوَىٰ ثَلَـٰثَةٍ إِلَّا هُوَ رَابِعُهُمْ وَلَا خَمْسَةٍ إِلَّا هُوَ سَادِسُهُمْ وَلَآ أَدْنَىٰ مِن ذَٰلِكَ وَلَآ أَكْثَرَ إِلَّا هُوَ مَعَهُمْ أَيْنَ مَا كَانُوا۟ ۖ ثُمَّ يُنَبِّئُهُم بِمَا عَمِلُوا۟ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَلِيمٌ","en":"Have you not considered that Allāh knows what is in the heavens and what is on the earth? There are not three in a private conversation but that He is the fourth of them, nor are there five but that He is the sixth of them - and no less than that and no more except that He is with them [in knowledge] wherever they are. Then He will inform them of what they did, on the Day of Resurrection. Indeed Allāh is, of all things, Knowing.","w":[{"ar":"أَلَمْ","tr":"alam","en":"Do not"},{"ar":"تَرَ","tr":"tara","en":"you see","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"أَنَّ","tr":"anna","en":"that"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","tr":"yaʿlamu","en":"knows","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"whatever"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"(is) in"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","tr":"l-samāwāti","en":"the heavens","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and whatever"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"(is) in"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","tr":"l-arḍi","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"يَكُونُ","tr":"yakūnu","en":"there is","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"any"},{"ar":"نَّجْوَىٰ","tr":"najwā","en":"secret counsel","root":"نجو","lem":"نَجْوَى"},{"ar":"ثَلَـٰثَةٍ","tr":"thalāthatin","en":"(of) three","root":"ثلث","lem":"ثَلاثَة"},{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"but"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"He (is)"},{"ar":"رَابِعُهُمْ","tr":"rābiʿuhum","en":"(the) fourth of them","root":"ربع","lem":"رابِع"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"خَمْسَةٍ","tr":"khamsatin","en":"five","root":"خمس","lem":"خَمْسَة"},{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"but"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"He (is)"},{"ar":"سَادِسُهُمْ","tr":"sādisuhum","en":"(the) sixth of them","root":"سدس","lem":"سادِس"},{"ar":"وَلَآ","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"أَدْنَىٰ","tr":"adnā","en":"less","root":"دنو","lem":"أَدْنَى"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"than"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika"